RocketLeague_Arena_Text_Official::
    .string "This is the ROCKET LEAGUE arena.\p"
    .string "Only serious challengers stand\n"
    .string "under these lights.$"

RocketLeague_Arena_Text_AreYouReady::
    .string "Are you ready?$"

RocketLeague_Arena_Text_PetrelIntro::
    .string "PETREL: Heh!\n"
    .string "You came looking for trouble?\p"
    .string "Then I'll give you a show worth\n"
    .string "every COIN.$"

RocketLeague_Arena_Text_ArcherIntro::
    .string "ARCHER: Discipline decides\n"
    .string "victory.\p"
    .string "Show me whether your ambition is\n"
    .string "anything more than noise.$"

RocketLeague_Arena_Text_ArianaIntro::
    .string "ARIANA: Careful now.\p"
    .string "TEAM ROCKET does not reward weak\n"
    .string "challengers.$"

RocketLeague_Arena_Text_ProtonIntro::
    .string "PROTON: So you're the next\n"
    .string "challenger?\p"
    .string "Fine.\n"
    .string "I'll make this quick.$"

RocketLeague_Arena_Text_GiovanniIntro::
    .string "GIOVANNI: Four victories in\n"
    .string "succession.\p"
    .string "You have earned the right to face\n"
    .string "the ROCKET LEAGUE CHAMPION.$"

RocketLeague_Arena_Text_PetrelDefeat::
    .string "Heh…\n"
    .string "Guess the smoke cleared your way.$"

RocketLeague_Arena_Text_ArcherDefeat::
    .string "So discipline alone was not\n"
    .string "enough.$"

RocketLeague_Arena_Text_ArianaDefeat::
    .string "Hmph.\n"
    .string "You are more polished than you look.$"

RocketLeague_Arena_Text_ProtonDefeat::
    .string "Tch!\n"
    .string "You made that take too long.$"

RocketLeague_Arena_Text_GiovanniDefeat::
    .string "Excellent.\p"
    .string "Your ambition has weight.$"

RocketLeague_Arena_Text_ReceivedCoins::
